          <span class="current-page" role="listitem" aria-current="page" >Tenth District Court of Appeals</span></span>
						            </nav>
					            </div>
                      
					            <div class="col-xs-12">
						            <div class="main-inner-container">
							            <div id="main-content" class="main-container clearfix">
							              
                            <!-- OC Layout Element Conent Template -->
							              <!--normalTemplateStart--><div class="department-container">
<div class="grid">
	<div class="col-xs-12 col-m-8">
		<h1 class='oc-page-title '>Tenth District Court of Appeals</h1>
		
	    <div class="wysiwyg-content body-content" ><div style="text-align: center;">
<div><img alt="Seal of the Tenth District Court of Appeals for the State of Ohio" src="/files/assets/public/v/1/court-of-appeals/images/10th-district-court-of-appeals-seal.jpeg" style="left: 70.5px; width: 922px; height: 214px;" /></div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The Tenth District Court of Appeals provides the following services to the residents of Franklin County:&nbsp;</p>
<ol>
<li style="text-align: left;">Hears appeals from all divisions of the Franklin County Court of Common Please, the Franklin County Municipal Court, the Ohio Court of Claims, and numerous state agencies.&nbsp;</li>
<li style="text-align: left;">Hears civil and criminal appeals, appeals from administrative agencies, as well as original actions.</li>
</ol>
<div>
<table align-left="" of-review-table="">
<tbody>
<tr data-fieldelementid="154602">
<td>
<p><em><span style="font-size: 100%;">The Court of Appeals of Ohio are located within twelve distinct jurisdictional districts throughout the state. Though most of these districts encompass multiple counties, the jurisdictional boundary of the Tenth District Court of Appeals encompasses only Franklin County.</span></em></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr />
<p><strong>View scheduled cases in the next 30 days</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www.tenthdistrictcourt.org/Magistrate" target="_blank" title="Magistrate Hearing Dates" class="styled-button-calltoaction"><span style="font-size: 125%;">Court Docket</span></a></p>
</div>

</div>
        
        
    </div>
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-m-4">
        
